Template: tmux-modal-probe/title
Type: title
Description: Daemons using outdated libraries

Template: tmux-modal-probe/restart
Type: multiselect
Choices: apache2.service, chrony.service, cron.service, ssh.service
Default: apache2.service, chrony.service, cron.service, ssh.service
Description: Which services should be restarted?

Template: tmux-modal-probe/kernel
Type: note
Description: Pending kernel upgrade
 Newer kernel available
 .
 The currently running kernel version is 6.8.0-40-generic which is not the
 expected kernel version 6.8.0-45-generic.
 .
 Restarting the system to load the new kernel will not be handled
 automatically, so you should consider rebooting.

Template: tmux-modal-probe/area
Type: select
Choices: Africa, America, Antarctica, Arctic, Asia, Atlantic, Australia, Europe, Indian, Pacific, Etc
Default: Europe
Description: Geographic area:
 Please select the geographic area in which you live.

Template: tmux-modal-probe/mailname
Type: string
Default: example.org
Description: System mail name:
 The "mail name" is the domain name used to "qualify" _ALL_ mail addresses
 without a domain name.

Template: tmux-modal-probe/password
Type: password
Description: New password for the database "root" user:
 While not mandatory, it is highly recommended that you set a password.

Template: tmux-modal-probe/save
Type: boolean
Default: true
Description: Save current IPv4 rules?
 Current iptables rules can be saved to the configuration file.
